A running dot other extensions can draw: compact-tools shares on globalThis
(Symbol.for("pi-compact-tools.running-dot")) paint(theme, id), the running tool
dot at the tool rows' frame, which keeps id animating while it is drawn, and
stop(id). thinking-rows paints its running Thinking row's dot with it.

